@ProjectTracker.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5104

### Health
GET {{ProjectTracker.API_HostAddress}}/healthz

### Log in (returns a token)
POST {{ProjectTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@example.com", "password": "change-me" }

### Projects, page 1, overdue first
GET {{ProjectTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/projects?status=Overdue&sortBy=endDate&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{ProjectTracker.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
